# `isolation.preview`

Resolve the isolation decision for an explicit tier/strategy without applying it.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.isolation.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `tier` | `string` |
| `strategy` | `string` |

